etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Unity发布Claude Code与OpenAI Codex官方插件，集成31项开发技能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI推出ChatGPT官方Word插件，免费用户可直接调用AI辅助写作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">迪士尼任命原Character.AI CEO阿南德为首位首席技术官</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/380fb1b5b60975a1a0b1d6c39525f5a5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">迪士尼于9月18日宣布，原Character.AI CEO卡兰迪普·阿南德将于10月2日正式出任公司首位首席技术官（CTO）兼高级执行副总裁，直接向CEO乔什·达马罗汇报。阿南德将统管迪士尼的企业技术、基础设施、数据与AI平台，以及产品与工程业务，旨在推动公司技术开发与交付方式的现代化。达马罗强调，阿南德在基础设施、消费科技及AI领域的复合经验，将助力迪士尼实现技术服务于创意及协同运营的战略目标。除阿南德外，迪士尼还从Character.AI技术团队吸纳了部分人才。阿南德此前曾任职于Brex及Meta，在Character.AI期间主导了消费级AI平台的快速增长。此次任命标志着迪士尼在强化AI布局与技术整合方面迈出关键一步，通过引入外部AI领军人才，进一步提升其在数字娱乐与技术基础设施领域的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国电信开源星辰大模型Xing4.0-29B-A4B，实现全栈国产化适配</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5afc3b3c3a405bca8f3b8d121f00e301.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中国电信于9月17日正式开源星辰大模型Xing4.0-29B-A4B。该模型总参数量29B，激活参数4B，原生支持256K上下文并可扩展至512K。作为国内首个实现从昇腾芯片训练到推理部署全栈国产化的百亿参数模型，其在SuperCLUE评测中智能体能力获93.52分，位列第三。该模型经4-bit量化后显存占用仅15GB，支持RTX3090/4090等消费级显卡本地部署。在生态兼容性方面，模型支持LLaMA-Factory、MindFormers微调，适配SGLang、vLLM、KTransformers推理框架，并对OpenCode、Claude Code等Agent框架进行定向调优。目前，模型已上线HuggingFace、GitHub、魔搭、Gitee及魔乐社区，为开发者提供全栈国产化的开源技术选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Unity发布Claude Code与OpenAI Codex官方插件，集成31项开发技能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d31c874a40da853b25b61f2dbfa23f9f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Unity正式发布由官方维护的Claude Code与OpenAI Codex两款插件，旨在为AI代码代理提供成套开发技能，适配Unity 6及更高版本。其中Codex版本内置31项开发技能，覆盖从零创建新项目到旧项目迁移至URP（通用渲染管线）等核心场景。该插件通过将AI代理与游戏引擎标准开发流程深度绑定，解决了通用AI代理因依赖过时文档导致代码生成质量不佳的问题，相当于为AI提供了实时更新的官方开发指南。此举标志着Unity正式下场规范AI代理在游戏与3D内容开发中的应用标准，通过官方工具链直接赋能开发者，降低AI辅助开发的门槛，并进一步巩固其在3D内容生产AI化趋势中的技术生态位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI推出ChatGPT官方Word插件，免费用户可直接调用AI辅助写作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式推出ChatGPT官方Word插件，面向全球所有账号开放，免费用户亦可直接体验。该插件集成于Word文档侧边栏，支持将笔记整理为初稿、生成长报告摘要、调整语气及统一术语等功能。付费与企业账号可进一步接入外部素材并保存常用技能，但插件额度与Codex等工具共享，且不支持跨文档读取或与网页版聊天记录互通。目前，Word文档内已形成微软Copilot、Claude for Word与ChatGPT插件三方竞争格局。此外，ChatGPT桌面版新增Appshots功能，支持截取任意软件窗口内容进行分析，进一步降低了AI调用门槛。此次更新标志着办公软件生态持续被AI重塑，用户在文档撰写中的角色正从内容创作者向指令发布者与决策者转变。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
